I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment call. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated, so importing HTTP would exceed the node's declared authority. The call would also send untrusted feed text to an external host. Once the platform team's grant lands in the graph definition, the node can be regenerated with that import.

